## 3. Network Architecture

A custom-mode VPC was created:

``` text
starfleet-vpc
```

Two regional subnets provide networking for the Alpha and Delta GKE
clusters.

### Alpha Quadrant

``` text
Subnet:   alpha-quadrant-subnet
Region:   us-central1

Nodes:    10.10.0.0/24
Pods:     10.20.0.0/16
Services: 10.30.0.0/20
```

Secondary range names:

``` text
alpha-pods
alpha-services
```

### Delta Quadrant

``` text
Subnet:   delta-quadrant-subnet
Region:   us-east1

Nodes:    10.40.0.0/24
Pods:     10.50.0.0/16
Services: 10.60.0.0/20
```

Secondary range names:

``` text
delta-pods
delta-services
```

The address ranges are non-overlapping and the GKE clusters use
VPC-native networking.

