## 7. Kubernetes Availability and Autoscaling

Application workloads use multiple replicas and topology spread
constraints to distribute pods across worker nodes.

The Navigation rollout strategy uses:

``` yaml
type: RollingUpdate
rollingUpdate:
  maxSurge: 0
  maxUnavailable: 1
```

Horizontal Pod Autoscaling was configured with:

``` text
API: autoscaling/v2
Minimum replicas: 2
Maximum replicas: 4
CPU target: 60%
```

Navigation autoscaling was tested on Alpha and successfully demonstrated
scaling from two replicas to three and returning to two after load
decreased.

