## 8. Workload Identity

GKE Workload Identity is used so Kubernetes workloads can access Google
Cloud services without storing long-lived service-account keys inside
containers.

Dedicated Google service accounts were created for the Navigation and
Communications workloads.

Kubernetes service accounts are mapped to the appropriate Google service
accounts.

Navigation successfully demonstrated authenticated Google Cloud access
using Workload Identity.

