## 12. Container Security and Binary Authorization

Trivy is used as a CI security gate.

The pipeline scans container images for:

``` text
HIGH
CRITICAL
```

severity vulnerabilities.

Binary Authorization is enabled and enforced on the Alpha cluster.

The implementation includes:

-   Cloud KMS
-   Container Analysis
-   attestor configuration
-   attestation creation
-   Binary Authorization policy
-   GitHub Actions integration

A validated Navigation release used the digest:

``` text
sha256:4bad968954586cdc9cc947f3730c811764e7c2aab9f215ef203b597128a627d3
```

The CI/CD pipeline creates the required attestation and deploys the
approved immutable digest.

