## 18. Global Static IP

A global static external IPv4 address is managed through Terraform.

Terraform resource name:

``` text
starfleet-global-gateway-ip
```

Reserved address:

``` text
34.49.192.254
```

The Kubernetes Gateway references the address using:

``` yaml
addresses:
  - type: NamedAddress
    value: starfleet-global-gateway-ip
```

This separates the public address lifecycle from the Gateway resource
and provides a stable endpoint suitable for future DNS configuration.

