## 22. Lab vs Production

The project intentionally uses several cost-conscious lab choices.

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Lab Implementation                  Production Direction
  ----------------------------------- -----------------------------------
  Zonal GKE clusters                  Regional GKE clusters

  Small node pools                    Capacity planning and node
                                      autoscaling

  Public-node lab architecture        Private nodes and controlled egress

  Direct cluster LoadBalancer         Remove unnecessary public cluster
  Services retained for validation    endpoints

  Single Grafana VM                   Highly available observability
                                      platform

  Flask development server            Production application server

  HTTP endpoint                       HTTPS with managed certificates

  Static IP without custom DNS        Owned domain and managed DNS

  Manual operational validation       Automated health, failover, and
                                      deployment tests
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------

The goal of the lab is to demonstrate the architecture and operational
concepts without incurring the cost of a full production platform.

